# IQ Cars pipeline: local-only operational files. Everything canonical is kept; see raw/iqcars_catalog.json.
# raw/iqcars_catalog.json embeds every cached response verbatim (1,653 cylinder_engine responses, the
# initial_data brands/models, 58 brand-new entries + their SFXes) and the run summaries (_meta.extraction_runs),
# so the per-request cache and logs are redundant and are not committed. Keep them locally if you want to re-assemble.

# per-request HTTP cache (1,713 files) and request/run logs
raw/cache/
raw/*.log
raw/request_log.jsonl
raw/run_summaries.jsonl

# task-baseline snapshots of unrelated working-tree state (git status dumps, diffs of other tools' files)
reports/baseline/

# bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
